OL,3,GNEWSA'I had football withdrawals during
OL,4,ATV race show'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeteran sports broadcaster Jeff
OL,7,FStelling said spending weeks without
OL,8,Fhis phone while taking part in
OL,9,FCelebrity Race Across The World meant
OL,10,Fhe could imagine his beloved Hartlepool
OL,11,FUnited FC were winning every game.
OL,13,FStelling and his son Matt are one of
OL,14,Ffour duos taking part in the show this
OL,15,Fyear, which sees teams traverse
OL,16,Fcountries with a limited budget and
OL,17,Ftechnology.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
