OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1793204797
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I had football withdrawals during
OL,4,ATV race show'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Tees, Stelling,
OL,7,F71, from Hartlepool, said the
OL,8,Fexperience was uplifting but he
OL,9,Fsuffered from football withdrawal
OL,10,Fsymptoms not being able to get the
OL,11,Fscores.
OL,13,F"Actually, as a Hartlepool fan, that's
OL,14,Fa blooming relief," he said. "Of
OL,15,Fcourse, you can fantasise that we're
OL,16,Fwinning every game when we're not."
